{"id":"eccf433851609ffb","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-ground-terms.md","title":"基项","display":"df-ground-terms — 基项","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"label":"56-df-ground-terms","aliases":["56-df-ground-terms"],"display":"df-ground-terms — 基项","type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §2.1, Definitions 7.1.5–7.1.6, printed pp25,262","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-ground-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-ground-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-terms — 基项"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §2.1, Definitions 7.1.5–7.1.6, printed pp25,262"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 及有限项的集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为任意形式表达式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\mathrm{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\mathrm{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §2.1、§7.1.5–7.1.6（印刷 pp25、262）。签名无常元时基项集合可以为空，因此不能无条件把它称作非空载体的代数。此定义只依赖项与变量，无须左线性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 及有限项的集合 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，见 [[56-df-terms]]。$\\mathrm{Var}(t)$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。$t$ 为任意形式表达式。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 及有限项的集合 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，见 [[56-df-terms]]。$\\mathrm{Var}(t)$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。$t$ 为任意形式表达式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\mathrm{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma).","display":true}],"bytes":1052,"backlinks":[{"id":"b4756bc85be4e874","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10806b2bbdb74dae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-term-algebra]] 的 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$、$T$。$G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}$ 见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]、[[56-df-variables]]；$f\\in F$。基项结构对所有签名定义，只有非空载体时才称为本书约定的代数。"},{"id":"9d543b3de707b0de","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，基项集合 $G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)$ 见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]。"},{"id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-terms.md]]"},{"id":"2b8f8c2d3844ca91","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-string-trs-translation]] 的有限字母表、非空左部规则、翻译 $⟦-⟧$ 与 $R_A$。$u,v\\in A^*$。$\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)$ 的基项记号见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]。"}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc","491e726b9c1f42b0"]}